[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS008
TITLE: Read back line up and wait, align, and wait
STATEMENT: >>>
From hold short, a line-up-and-wait clearance shall be read back as Line up and wait runway and the spoken runway, then the call sign. The aircraft shall taxi onto the runway to 100 feet past the threshold, align with the runway heading, and stop. It shall not begin the takeoff roll until a takeoff clearance. Acceptance is that readback and a stopped, aligned aircraft still in the line-up phase.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Line up and wait is not a takeoff clearance.
<<<
DAL: E
